Package: causaliflower
Title: Build and Assess Causal Graphs
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R:
    person("Aidan", "Moller", , "aidan.moller@adelaide.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Extends 'dagitty' and 'ggdag' with functions to build, edit and plot
    causal graphs in R. Also provides guided assessment of causal arrows and
    checks whether causal effects are identifiable.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/AAGI-AUS/causaliflower
